  "body": "The examples are overwhelming and misplaced as-is.\n- [x] Move all examples of creating streams to an appendix\n- [x] Flesh out examples of using streams to make sure we capture the essence\n- [x] Reduce complexity of creating-stream examples. One major potential simplification is to wrap underlying sources/sinks that use promises instead of callbacks.\n- [x] Consider placing examples of method usage inside the section for that method?\n- [x] Add examples of creating and using strategies to each strategy's section.\n- [x] Add examples of encapsulating a single \"resource\" (web socket, probably) in a { input, output } pair.\n",
